          <p>I&rsquo;ve bought plenty of family heirlooms and Fullerton-era Fenders that just weren&rsquo;t being played anymore. Here&rsquo;s my promise to every seller: the guitar you sell me will go on doing what Leo Fender built it to do, get <strong>played!</strong> I treat every one of them with respect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="smf-process__card">
